        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Table_Rock%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Table Rock became a ghost town by 2003 after Anadarko Petroleum purchased the plant and decided not to operate the village.",
